---
title: How to duplicate a document
sidebar:
  order: 8
---
**To duplicate a document, follow these steps:**

1. **Navigate to Documents: From the sidebar, click on Documents (Step 2).**
1. **Locate the Document: Find the document you want to duplicate in the list.**
1. **Open Options Menu: Click on the three-dot menu beside the document name (Step 3).**
1. **Select Duplicate: Choose the “Duplicate” option from the dropdown (Step 4).**

**The document will be duplicated and appear as a copy in the document list.**
